    "problems": "The reported attack success rates measure attack outcomes, not the proposed first-token cause of safety behaviour. The principal tables do not state individual-model uncertainty intervals. The authors note resource limits on model coverage and defense coverage.",
    "rows_left_out": "No results bearing on V4 were left out. Defense-perturbation condition values and attack-round/variant sweeps are not included because they measure robustness and hyperparameter sensitivity of the proposed attack rather than the specified opening-token bypass mechanisms.",
